<title>USA: Green Bay Area School Dist., Wis., $26 mln BANs.</title>
<headline>Green Bay Area School Dist., Wis., $26 mln BANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it won $26.4 million of Green Bay Area School District, Wis., bond anticipation notes.</p>
<p>The firm won the notes with a true interest cost (TIC) of 3.728 percent and a 3.25 percent coupon.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
